{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">BASE64-DECODE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":939,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308928","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BASE64-DECODE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BASE64-DECODE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">BASE64-DECODE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts a Base64 character string into a binary\nvalue. The result is a MEMPTR containing the binary data.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__syntax_GC154J2680118\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d19789e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__idGDE1XH2662224\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>BASE64-DECODE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A CHARACTER or LONGCHAR expression containing the string you\nwant to convert.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__note_N1008B_N1002F_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> The <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-ENCODE</code>,\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-DECODE</code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-ENCODE</code>, and\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-DECODE</code> functions do not do any byte ordering. However, the binary\n        output of these functions may be a binary data type such as a MEMPTR or RAW. If the target\n        of these operation’s output is another system where the order of bytes (endianness) differs,\n        you must first normalize the data to what the receiving side is expecting. Otherwise, the\n        results may not be as expected. For example, for a MEMPTR value that you are building\n        yourself, you can use the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a> to set the byte order for the\n        MEMPTR variable before you read or write the value.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__example_GC154K2680124\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d19789e159\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Following is an example using the <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-DECODE</code>\n        function:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__idGDE1XI2662230\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE decdmptr AS MEMPTR   NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE decdlngc AS LONGCHAR NO-UNDO.\n\nCOPY-LOB FROM FILE &quot;C:\\myicons\\testencode&quot; TO decdlngc.\ndecdmptr = BASE64-DECODE(decdlngc).\nCOPY-LOB FROM decdmptr TO FILE &quot;C:\\myicons\\test.ico&quot;.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-DECODE-function__see-also_GC18PA2694179\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d19789e191\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\"><a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\">BASE64-ENCODE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"AVAILABLE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/AVAILABLE-function.html\">AVAILABLE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\">BASE64-ENCODE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308928","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":938,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"BASE64-DECODE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-DECODE-function.html","type":"Manual"}